Third-party material included in this repository:

- replicate/analysis/models/evo2/configs/evo2-7b-1m.yml (as-run copy: as_run/models/evo2/configs/evo2-7b-1m.yml)
  is a modified copy of a configuration file shipped with the evo2 Python package (Arc Institute), licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0 per the package metadata. Modification: use_fp8_input_projections set
  to False (the RTX 3090 has no FP8 support).
- intermediates/evo2_rule_controls_out.tsv holds Evo 2 7B scores computed by the authors for public ClinVar
  variants (NCBI ClinVar, release 2026-10-11).
- intermediates/borzoi_control_scores.tsv holds, for 120 GTEx v8 Whole Blood eQTL variants on chromosome 15, the
  gene, position, alleles, normalised effect size and p-value as returned by the GTEx Portal API v2 on 2026-10-19
  (open-access GTEx summary data; the Genotype-Tissue Expression (GTEx) Project was supported by the Common Fund of
  the Office of the Director of the National Institutes of Health, and by NCI, NHGRI, NHLBI, NIDA, NIMH and NINDS),
  together with 120 random chromosome-15 positions and the Borzoi scores computed by the authors for all 240.
- references/ClinGen_gene_curation_list_GRCh38.tsv is an unmodified copy of the ClinGen gene curation list, GRCh38,
  release of 16 Oct 2026, downloaded on 2026-10-17 from https://ftp.clinicalgenome.org/ClinGen_gene_curation_list_GRCh38.tsv.
  ClinGen curated content is available free of restriction under the CC0 1.0 Universal dedication
  (https://clinicalgenome.org/docs/terms-of-use/). As ClinGen requests: Clinical Genome Resource (ClinGen),
  https://clinicalgenome.org, accessed 2026-10-17; Rehm HL et al., "ClinGen, the Clinical Genome Resource",
  N Engl J Med 372:2235-2242 (2015).

